      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6122e1c0cd0793126de231da|full_name} Can you please provide a public avatar ID in which this behaviour is expected to work?  Also knowing the controller setup you are using might help pinpoint the issue, even if not the root cause. I assume you are playing the animation on the Base layer so the Gesture layer can override the hand animation?",
