      "value": "@{64067e3f61dc8840a8623a28|full_name}: you just need to use other parameters to work as GestureLeft and GestureRight (example: create two synced int parameters GestureLeft~ and GestureRight~, and if GestureLeft = 1, you set the GestureLeft~ to 1 and use it as your Gesture Left parameter. You must do the same for GestureLeft = 0, 2, 3, etc)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
