      "value": "@{5f4ba617a657d93390b5364b|full_name}: That's right.You can change facial expressions even during forced emotes by providing separate synchronised parameters. However, most existing avatar models do not take such measures. Also, many light users cannot understand such complex FX settings. I'm waiting for the bug to be fixed so that the facial expressions can be changed during emotes using the gestures provided from the start, as they should be. At least a year ago this would have been normal.",
