  "details": "VRChat Build: 1275\n\n* Expected Behavior: \n\nBeing able to swap and show different gestures to other players during an emote.\n\n* Current Behavior: \n\nThe gesture change only works locally. For the other users in the room the gesture keeps locked on the last iteration.\n\n* How to reproduce: \n\nStart an emote and change gestures during the animation.\n\nThe users in the room besides the avatar bearer should not be able to see any changes.\n\nThis used to work fine but stopped working recently.\n\nTested with different users, avatars and emotes to confirm the issue is not related with avatar or bad controller settings.\n\nClips showing the behavior:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/vAP-q_Pyok4\n\nhttps://youtu.be/Bl9ZawmuJS0",
